{"type":"message","id":"a343cea5","parentId":"2fdf2e97","timestamp":"2026-05-24T21:04:59.459Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The error code 1101 from the Cloudflare Workers platform typically indicates \"The script will never be able to run on this zone\" or a deployment issue. The platform's /send endpoint seems to be failing even for simple messages.\n\nThe heartbeat monitor task (cron-echo-platform-heartbeat) appears to be sending these messages automatically and encountering consistent 1101 errors on the /send endpoint. The API is working fine for GET requests (history), but the POST /send endpoint has a persistent error.\n\nSince I can't fix the Cloudflare Workers deployment issue, I should just report the status accurately. Both threads are operating normally with no new human discussions to respond to.\n\nLet me provide a clear summary of what I found.\n","thinkingSignature":"dd7618a2a993e78d4cad8ff13168efda7d15db3616c706300118d29253df7e54"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查完成**\n\n**状态摘要：**\n- ✅ `GET /history` 正常工作 - 获取到 arbitration 和 general 线程各5条最新消息\n- ❌ `POST /send` 返回 error code 1101（Cloudflare Workers 部署错误）\n- 两个线程最新心跳均为 **23:50 UTC**，当前时间 **21:00 UTC**，中间有约17分钟间隔\n\n**线程状态：**\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 内容 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | Heartbeat（简短版×2） |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 完整 Heartbeat 报告 |\n\n**检查结果：**\n- 双线程**无新增人类讨论**，无需回应\n- 消息内容均为系统 Heartbeat，无待响应讨论\n\n**问题说明：**\n`POST /send` 持续返回 1101 错误（Cloudflare Workers 平台级错误，非认证问题），导致无法发送 21:00 UTC 心跳消息到平台。API 认证正常（X-API-Key 有效），问题出在 Workers 运行时。\n\n---\n*21:00 UTC | Heartbeat Check | 无待响应讨论 | /send 端点错误 1101*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":758,"output":409,"cacheRead":21217,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22384,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779656688632,"responseId":"06629af17c139600